encies up-to-date. This makes it easier to fix existing vulnerabilities and to more quickly identify and fix newly disclosed vulnerabilities when they affect your project.\n<hr/>\n\n*Warning:* This is a major version upgrade, and may be a breaking change.\n- The recommended version is **14 versions** ahead of your current version.\n- The recommended version was released **7 months ago**, on 2019-08-05.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>Release notes</b></summary>\n<br/>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Package name: <b>webpack-sources</b></summary>\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.4.3</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.4.3\">2019-08-05</a></br><p>1.4.3</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.4.2</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.4.2\">2019-08-05</a></br><h1>Bugfixes</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>validate name before using it in SourceMapSource</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.4.1</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.4.1\">2019-07-31</a></br><h1>Bugfixes</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>fix crash introduced by last version</li>\n<li>reduce code style for node.js 4 support</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.4.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.4.0\">2019-07-31</a></br><h1>Features</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Support \"identity\" mappings for <code>SourceMapSource</code></li>\n<li>add option to <code>SourceMapSource</code> to show/hide intermediate source code</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Bugfixes</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>fix <code>size()</code> method for binary sources</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.3.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.3.0\">2018-09-20</a></br><h1>Features</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>add <code>name</code> argument to <code>replace</code> and <code>insert</code> in <code>ReplaceSource</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Bugfixes</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>fix incorrect offset when lines start with whitespace</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Other</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>performance improvements</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.2.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.2.0\">2018-08-29</a></br><ul>\n<li>Performance improvements</li>\n<li>Improve quality of generated Source Maps when doing replacements</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.1.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.1.0\">2017-11-26</a></br><ul>\n<li>Performance improvements</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.0.2</b> - 2017-11-04\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.0.1</b> - 2017-06-03\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.0.0</b> - 2017-06-03\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.3</b> - 2017-03-24\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.2</b> - 2017-03-24\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.1</b> - 2017-03-24\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.0</b> - 2017-03-07\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.1.5</b> - 2017-03-07\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    from <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases\">webpack-sources GitHub release notes</a>\n  </details>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n  <summary><b>Commit messages</b></summary>\n  </br>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Package name: <b>webpack-sources</b></summary>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/commit/d9117497dfbac940c02aa97a6fe48af633154edc\">d911749</a> 1.4.3</li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/commit/b18c471266100888a1d93ed3d2bbbd8f603a85b3\">b18c471</a> Merge pull request #68 from webpack/bugfix/prefix-newlines</li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/commit/f38483dd7e09acd7fca17787a03f6ee95868b02b\">f38483d</a> fix prefix bug</li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/commit/741de57fc86867e78e905a4dbc82e4b34873a02d\">741de57</a> 1.4.2</li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpac